# /private/var/sweetmtl/clients for mtltest boots (tools/sweetmtl/README.md, M1-M2): the processes the SweetMetal
# plug-in gives a Metal device, one process name per line. mkrootfix --write rewrites it at every boot of the blob.
# backboardd and SpringBoard are not listed: they stay on GLES (sweetgl) until M5.
mtltest
